				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[Note: (1) Customers include both asset side and liability side customers; (2) There should be no double counting among the NPOs. A trust that is also a charity should be classified under charities only. A non-governmental organisation that is also a religious organisation should be classified under religious organisations only; (3) No. of customers include all customers of the NBDTI as at end of the quarter.]]></text>
